                "question": "When playing Rimewind, can I select an enemy advanced follower?",
                "answer": "Yes, you can. Advanced followers are also considered \"unevolved\" followers."
              },
              {
                "title": "Q1671 (Nov. 14, 2025)",
                "question": "If I can't select a Resolve of the Nine-Tailed Fox in my cemetery, can I still pick option 2 and have nothing happen?",
                "answer": "No. If you can't select a Resolve of the Nine-Tailed Fox in your cemetery, you would be required to choose option 1."
